      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "impact_statement": "The advisory is specific to command injection in the SQLite command-line shell's .recover output. Both images contain sqlite-libs but no sqlite package or sqlite3 executable; Python's SQLite library remains available. The CLI-only vulnerable code is absent. This exact-image assessment requires security reviewer acceptance. Sources: https://github.com/sqlite/sqlite/blob/version-3.54.1/src/shell.c.in and https://www.sqlite.org/cli.html"
